text.section:
Product labels for all cannabis products and botanical cannabis shall be complete, accurate, easily discernable, and uniform among different products and brands. Pharmaceutical processors shall affix to all cannabis products and botanical cannabis a label, which shall also be accessible on the pharmaceutical processor's website, that includes:

The product name;


All active and inactive ingredients, including cannabinoids, terpenes, additives, preservatives, flavorings, sweeteners, and carrier oils;


The total percentage and milligrams of tetrahydrocannabinol and cannabidiol included in the product and the number of milligrams of tetrahydrocannabinol and cannabidiol in each serving;


The amount of product that constitutes a single serving and the amount recommended for use by the practitioner or dispensing pharmacist;


Information regarding the product's purpose and detailed usage directions;


Child and safety warnings in a conspicuous font; and


Such other information required by the Board.
